# GradInvite frontend environment.
# Copy to frontend/.env for local use (that file is gitignored).
# Vite only exposes variables that start with VITE_, and it bakes them into the bundle at build time.
#
# The API is called at the relative path /api/trpc. In development Vite proxies it to the backend on port 3000;
# in production the backend serves the built frontend itself, so no API URL variable is needed.
# Sign-in needs no frontend variables: the JWT from the backend is kept in localStorage.
# There are currently no required keys; add VITE_ variables here as features need them.
